{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104954","id":2435925052,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6RMUQ8","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104954","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104954.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104954.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104954","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104954/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104954/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104954/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1e0f362091a49e7f0a0c1a8f538475c3c963c160","number":104954,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add quick access to Movie Maker output path in editor bar","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11541 .\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a button to the editor's run bar next to the Movie Maker button. Clicking the button opens a popup window where the Movie Maker output path can be changed.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d691c983-b1a4-4745-a270-282db0f7cff7\r\n\r\nTo help accomplish this, it also includes a new class, `EditorFilepathSelect`, which consists of a `LineEdit` and a `Button`. Clicking the `Button` opens a file dialog, and choosing a file from the dialog populates the `LineEdit` with its path.\r\n\r\n## To Do\r\n- [x] Update the project setting when focus leaves the `LineEdit`\r\n- [ ] Include a checkbox for setting the current scene's movie path instead of the global project path(?)\r\n- [x] Set the `EditorFilepathSelect`'s accepted file types\r\n\r\nIt isn't necessary for this PR specifically, and would probably increase the amount of time it takes by a lot, so unless it is very desired I won't try to add additional settings to `EditorFilepathSelect` until perhaps a future PR.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-04-03T04:45:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T00:42:12Z","closed_at":"2025-05-29T05:22:38Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Meorge:feat/movie-